config NET_RTL819X
	bool "Realtek RTL8197F (RTL819x) switch-core Ethernet (DIR-842 driver)"
	depends on RTL8197F && HAS_DMA && HAS_IOMEM
	depends on RTL8367B_PHY=y
	select CRC32
	help
	  Ethernet driver for the CPU port of the switch core of the Realtek
	  RTL8197F with an external RTL8367S/RTL8367RB-VB switch on port 0
	  (RGMII), from the D-Link DIR-842 R1 OpenWrt port.  The SoC inserts
	  and strips the Realtek CPU tag in hardware; LAN and WAN reach Linux
	  as eth0.2 and eth0.1, the external switch is configured by the
	  rtl8367b swconfig driver.

	  bool, not tristate: the objects mix module_platform_driver() with
	  late_initcall(), and it calls into the built-in rtl8367b driver.
